            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "That's an interesting idea indeed. At the moment I feel that using folds with `foldmethod=indent` and properly formatted json/yaml gives similar experience. Although maybe a bit more verbose on key presses (`zj` / `zk` / `za` instead of `j` / `k` / `l`). Just has to get used to folds. But I'll keep this idea in mind.",
